==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 6~10 seconds<sup>180f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 6~10 seconds<sup>180f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 6~10 seconds<sup>180f~300f</sup>.
*4 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 10.67~23.33 seconds<sup>320f~700f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 80% HP:
**4 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Just use meatshields and mid-ranged attackers, such as [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Dual]] [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Erasers]] and [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Slapstick Cats]], if you have it. If not, just use [[Crazed Bird Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Bird]] and/or [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg]].

